<title>RUSSIA: Russian inflation quickens to 0.3 pct latest week.</title>
<headline>Russian inflation quickens to 0.3 pct latest week.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian inflation accelerated in the week from October 29 to November 4 to 0.3 percent from 0.2 percent in the previous week, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Prices have risen 18.1 percent so far this year, it said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    w/e Nov 4	    w/e Oct 28</p>
<p>    Week-on-week change		+0.3		    +0.2</p>
<p>					   Nov 1-4		Oct 1-31</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation	  +0.047		  +0.038</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
